摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Playwright-powered browser automation for DeepSeek Harness","id":"gh:1333312257","install_available":true,"language":"TypeScript","name":"dsh-browser","slug":"ben7am1n/dsh-browser","topics":["browser-automation","deepseek-harness","dsh-plugin","playwright","typescript"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Playwright-powered browser automation for DeepSeek Harness"},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# dsh-browser"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"Browser automation for DeepSeek Harness: a Playwright-powered `browser_*` tool family so the agent c"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"an drive real web pages — fill forms, click through flows, scrape SPA content, and take screenshots "},{"id":"p3s3","text":"it can then view with `read_image`."},{"id":"p4s1","text":"## Install"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"The plugin depends on `playwright-core` (bundled with the package) and needs a Chromium-based browse"},{"id":"p6s2","text":"r. It tries `chromium`, then `chrome`, then `msedge` channels automatically; if none is found:"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p8s1","text":"or configure `launch.executablePath` / `launch.channel` in the plugin config."},{"id":"p9s1","text":"## Tools"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"| Tool | Purpose |"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"| `browser_open` | Open (or reuse) the browser, optionally navigate to a URL |\n| `browser_navigate` "},{"id":"p11s2","text":"| Navigate the current page and wait for load |\n| `browser_click` | Click an element by CSS selector"},{"id":"p11s3","text":" |\n| `browser_type` | Type text into an input (optionally press Enter) |\n| `browser_select` | Select"},{"id":"p11s4","text":" option(s) in a `<select>` |\n| `browser_screenshot` | Capture a PNG to `<workspace>/browser-screensh"},{"id":"p11s5","text":"ots/`; view it with `read_image` |\n| `browser_eval` | Evaluate JavaScript in the page, return JSON |"},{"id":"p11s6","text":"\n| `browser_get_text` / `browser_get_html` | Read visible text or outer HTML |\n| `browser_wait` | Wa"},{"id":"p11s7","text":"it for slow pages / lazy content |\n| `browser_close` | Close the browser (reopenable by any tool) |\n"},{"id":"p11s8","text":"| `browser_install` | Explain or verify browser availability |"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"The browser persists across tool calls — open once, drive many times, close when done."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Configuration"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"| Field | Default | Meaning |"},{"id":"p15s1","text":"| `launch.executablePath` | — | Absolute path to a browser binary (takes precedence) |\n| `launch.cha"},{"id":"p15s2","text":"nnel` | auto (`chromium` → `chrome` → `msedge`) | Browser channel |\n| `launch.navigationTimeoutMs` |"},{"id":"p15s3","text":" — | Default navigation/action timeout |\n| `launch.viewport` | `1280×800` | Page viewport |\n| `scree"},{"id":"p15s4","text":"nshotDir` | `browser-screenshots` | Screenshot directory under the workspace |"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p17s1","text":"## Notes"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"- Runs headless by default; a headed mode may come later.\n- Screenshots land in the calling agent's "},{"id":"p18s2","text":"workspace so the model can read them with `read_image`."},{"id":"p19s1","text":"## License"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"MIT"}],"truncated":false}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
